        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "月亮没有脚",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "月亮怎么移动了！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "太阳也会移动的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "月亮没有脚，它怎么会动？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我现在想，是不是太阳一动不动，我们地球绕着太阳转？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "以后你可能会学到月亮为什么会动，我现在解释不清楚。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-27-moon-has-no-feet_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
